    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by the Minister of Finance and Mass Mediaon 22nd of May, 2018\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 250]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on April 12, 2018)\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n2\u2014PL 010799\u2014540 (05/2018)\n\nLAND (RESTRICTIONS ON ALIENATION)(AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Land (Restrictions on Alienation) Act, No. 38 of 2014\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 3 of the Land (Restrictions on Alienation)Act, No. 38 of 2014 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to extend the application of the exemption granted bythat section to certain properties.\n\nClause 3: This clause amends section 5A of the principal enactment, and the legal effectof the section as amended is to amend the effective date of that section.\n\nLand (Restrictions on Alienation)(Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n2\u2014PL 010739\u2014475 (04/2018)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 11/2018\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LAND (RESTRICTIONS ON ALIENATION)ACT, NO. 38 OF 2014\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Land (Restrictions onAlienation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2018 and shall comeinto operation on April 1, 2018.\n\n2.Section 3 of the Land (Restrictions on Alienation)Act, No. 38 of 2014 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (1):\u2014\n\n(a)by the repeal of paragraph (b) of that subsection andthe substitution therefor of the followingparagraph:\u2014\n\n\u201c(b)a condominium parcel specified under theApartment Ownership Law:\n\nProvided that, the entire value shall bepaid upfront through an inward foreignremittance prior to the execution of therelevant deed of transfer;\u201d;"
