    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPRADESHIYA SABHAS (AMENDMENT)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Provincial Councils and Local Government on05th of April, 2018\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 17, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 241]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nto amend the Pradeshiya Sabhas Act, No. 15 of 1987.\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 19 of the Pradeshiya Sabhas Act, No. 15 of 1987(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of this sectionas amended is to enable Pradeshiya Sabhas to spend any part of the Pradeshiya Sabha Fundfor development activities in estate settlements.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 33 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof this section as amended is to enable Pradeshiya Sabhas to construct and maintain roadsand other common amenities in the plantation regions upon adoption of a special resolutionand in concurrence with the administrative authority of the relevant estate.\n\n1Pradeshiya Sabhas (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 3/2016\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PRADESHIYA SABHAS ACT, NO. 15 OF 1987\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Pradeshiya Sabhas(Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.\n\n2.Section 19 of the Pradeshiya Sabhas Act, No. 15 of1987 (hereinafter in this Act referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (1) of thatsection as follows:\u2014\n\n(1)by the substitution, in paragraph (xiv) for the words\u201cimprovement or maintenance of village works,\u201dof the words \u201cimprovement or maintenance ofvillage works or estate settlements,\u201d;"
