    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of March 09, 2018\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 14.03.2018)\n\nPRESCRIPTION (SPECIAL PROVISIONS)(AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Prescription (Special Provisions) Act, No. 5 of 2016.\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 4 of the Prescription (Special Provisions) Act, No. 5of 2016 in order to extend the time period within which a disadvantaged person is entitled to availhimself of the benefits of the Act.\n\n1Prescription (Special Provisions)(Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nShort title.\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 39/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PRESCRIPTION (SPECIAL PROVISIONS)ACT, NO. 5 OF 2016\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Prescription (SpecialProvisions) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.\n\n2.Section 4 of the Prescription (Special Provisions) Act,No. 5 of 2016 is hereby amended as follows:\u2014\n\n(1)by the substitution for the words \u201ctwo years afterthe coming into operation of this Act.\u201d of the words\u201cfour years from the date of coming into operationof this Act.\u201d;\n\n(2)by the substitution for the words \u201ctwo years afterthe date of operation of this Act.\u201d, in the marginalnote to that section, of the words \u201cfour years fromthe date of coming into operation of this Act.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 4of Act, No. 5of 2016.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nPrescription (Special Provisions)(Amendment)2\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
