    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSRI NATHA AHASTHANA INTERNATIONALBUDDHIST MEDITATION CENTREPERFORMANCE SOCIETY(INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. J. M. Ananda Kumarasiri, M. P. forMonaragala District on 23rd of January, 2018\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 22, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto incorporate the Sri Natha Ahasthana International BuddhistMeditation Centre Performance Society\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 229]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Sri Natha Ahasthana International BuddhistMeditation Centre Performance Society(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI NATHA AHASTHANA INTERNATIONALBUDDHIST MEDITATION CENTRE PERFORMANCE SOCIETY\n\nWHEREAS a Society called and known as the \u201cSri NathaAhasthana International Buddhist Meditation CentrePerformance Society\u201d has heretofore been formed in SriLanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objectsand transacting all matters connected with the said Societyaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Soiety has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was established, and has applied to be incorporatedand it will be expendient to grant the said application:\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Natha AhasthanaInternational Buddhist Meditation Centre PerformanceSociety (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2018."
