    "chunk_text": "NIMAL RUPASINGHE FRIENDSHIP FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Nimal Rupasinghe Friendship Foundation\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. Ishak Rahuman, M. P. for Anuradhapura Districton 23rd of January, 2018.\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 230]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on January 08, 2018)\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nNimal Rupasinghe Friendship Foundation(Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 010474\u2014300 (11/2017)\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE NIMAL RUPASINGHE FRIENDSHIPFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an society called and known as the \u201cNimalRupasinghe Friendship Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenformed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carryingout its objects and transacting all matters connected with thesaid Foundation according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application.\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Nimal RupasingheFriendship Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2018.\n\n2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so may persons as now are members of the NimalRupasinghe Friendship Foundation (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereinafter be admitted as membersof the \u201cNimal Rupasinghe Friendship Foundation\u201d(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by thatname may sue and be sued with full power and authority to haveand use a common seal and to alter the same at its pleasure."
