    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 226]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Finance and Mass Mediaon 11th of December, 2017.\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 24, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n2 PL 010549\u2014\u2013510 (12/2017)\n\nEXCISE (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 15 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), and thelegal effect of the section as amended is to include the requirement of obtaining a license fortapping any palmyrah tree and coconut tree which produces toddy.\n\n1Excise (Amendment)\n\n2\u2014PL 010389\u2014 475 (10/2017)\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 63/2016\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE EXCISE ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 52)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Excise (Amendment)Act, No. of 2017 and shall come into operation onJanuary 1, 2018.\n\n2.Section 15 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) ishereby amended by the repeal of paragraphs (b) and (c) ofthat section, and the substitution therefor of the following:\u2014\n\n\u201c(b)no tree producing toddy, other than kithul tree shallbe tapped;\n\n(c)no toddy shall be drawn or lowered from any treeother than the kithul tree.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 15of the ExciseOrdinance(Chapter 52).\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Excise (Amendment)"
