    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of November 17, 2017\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 17.11.2017)\n\nAPPROPRIATION (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Appropriation Act, No. 24 of 2016.\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance and Mass Media\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 24 of 2016 and the legaleffect of that section as amended is to increase the borrowing limit of the Government for year2017.\n\nAppropriation (Amendment)1\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 58/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE APPROPRIATION ACT, NO. 24 OF 2016\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Appropriation(Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 24 of 2016 ishereby amended in subsection (1) of that section, by thesubstitution in paragraph (b) of that subsection for the words\u201cshall not exceed rupees one thousand five hundred seventynine billion one hundred ten million four hundred thirty sixthousand\u201d, of the words \u201cshall not exceed rupees one thousandsix hundred twenty nine billion\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\nPL 010459 \u2014475 (11/2017)\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseofinconsistency.\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of Act,No. 24 of 2016.\n\nAppropriation (Amendment)2"
