    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 211]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Dinesh Gunawardena, M. P. forColombo District on 09th of October, 2017.\n\n(Published in the Gazette on September 25, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2\u2014PL 010374\u2014 260 (10/2017)\n\nSRI SHAKYASINHARAMA VIHARASTHAKARYASADHAKA SANVIDANAYA(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Sri Shakyasinharama Viharastha KaryasadhakaSanvidanaya\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Sri Shakyasinharama Viharastha KaryasadhakaSanvidanaya (Incorporation)\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2 PL 005447\u2014 300 (09/2017)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI SHAKYASINHARAMAVIHARASTHA KARYASADHAKA SANVIDANAYA\n\nWHEREAS an Organization called and known as the\u201cSri Shakyasinharama Viharastha KaryasadhakaSanvidanaya\u201d has heretofore been created for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Organization:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters of the Organization and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri ShakyasinharamaViharastha Karyasadhaka Sanvidanaya (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2017."
  },
