    "chunk_text": "9Thareeqathul Aroosiyyathil QaadhiriyyahAssociation of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\nList of Institutions\n\n1.Magnamus Suada Thaika,No. 159, Old Moor Street, Colombo 12.\n\n2.Al-Masjidul Bukhary Thaika, No. 25, Imamul Aroos Mawatha,Maradana, Colombo 10.\n\n4.Katakala Marathady Thaika and Shrine, No. 32, Clifton Lane,Dematagoda, Colombo 09.\n\n5.Hussain Waliyullah Thaika aka As-Sheikhu AsseyiduMuhammadu Hussain Waliyullah Thaika,No. 677, Colombo-Galle Road,Gintota.\n\n6.Khalwat Thakkiya,Godawatta, Wakwella Road, Gintota.\n\n7.Masjid Muhyiddeen Thakkiya,No. 37, H. K. Edmund Mawatha, Miliduwa,Galle.\n\n8.Magnam Abkal Hamdu Thakkiya,Matara Road, Katugoda, Galle.\n\n9.Masjidul Aroosiya Thakkiya,Akuressa Road, Nugaduwa, Galle.\n\n10.Bukhary Mosque and Madrasa,Buhary Masjid Mawatha, Galbokka,Weligama.\n\n11.Ma\u2019lul Khairath Thakkiya,No. 4, St. Servatius Road, Yehiya Kotuwegoda, Matara.\n\n12.Malharus Salah Thaika,No. 49, (Old No. 917), Yehiya Mawatha, Matara.\n\n13.Muhyddeen Aroosia Qadirriya Thaika,No. 40, Walker Street, Hambantota.\n\n14. Aroos Moulana Maqbarah Shrine,Andiyakadawatta, Gampola.\n\n15. Mapillai Alim Khalwath Jalwath Thaika,Ward 1, Thakwa Nagar, Pulmoddai.\n\n[Section 2(3)]\n\n10Thareeqathul Aroosiyyathil QaadhiriyyahAssociation of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nThe Rules and Regulations of the Corporation\n\n1. Membership to the Corporation shall be open to all personsprofessing the sunnath wal jamaath Islamic faith.\n\n2. Unless otherwise amended all rules hithertobefore relating to theAssociation shall continue to apply to the Corporation including rulesrelating to\u2014\n\n(a)the conduct of spiritual activities;\n\n(b)the persons who would provide spiritual and religiousservices;\n\n(c)the number of trustees, their appointment, removal,disciplinary control and dismissal ;\n\n(d)the number of members, their admission, removal,disciplinary control and expulsion;\n\n(e)succession of the Spiritual Head; and\n\n(f)rules relating to the basic tenets of the Corporation."
