    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 214]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Bandula Lal Bandarigoda, M. P.for Galle District on 20th October, 2017\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 02, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPrice : Rs. 17.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n2-PL 010403 \u2014260 (10/2017)\n\nHESHA FRIENDSHIP FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Hesha Friendship Foundation\n\n2-2d\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n1Hesha Friendship Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 005442\u2014 300 (09/2017)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE HESHA FRIENDSHIP FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Association called and known as the\u201cHesha Friendship Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formedin Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Hesha FriendshipFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2017."
